{"title":"2016 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8afa9450001832b867b852887556986ed03d1e32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 - 1 \\times 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/8/5a8cbcd2a12306d443b38564bd02c3106175526e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 - 1 \\times 6 = 2 + 0 - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"201\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f99fbbc65da4e6c1102601a53c86145cfc171b6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 - 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c37831752e80e596e801910bb44bd42fe79a08a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{-4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"56\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align